From a3d606720637226e393ae67fb36d49dbd891549a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:17:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add reading time estimation utility for notes

Extracts plain text from a note's MFM (dropping URLs, emojis and
markup) and estimates how long it takes to read it. CJK text
(kanji, kana, hangul) is counted per character at 500 chars/min and
everything else per word at 200 words/min. getReadingTime returns
null for notes whose plain text is 500 characters or shorter.
